{
  "_about": "Recovered layouts of Mech3.exe 1.2 objects (32-bit). Field rows: [offset, type, name, note]. Class names are ours unless docs/structs.md says otherwise. Applied to Ghidra by tools/ghidra/ApplyTypes.java; prose in docs/structs.md.",
